                ['Is it really free?', 'Yes. The tools are free to use and to embed, with no ads. A small "Free tools by Stackapella" link sits under the tool.'],
                ['Does it set cookies or track my visitors?', 'No. The embed sets no cookies and keeps no record of who uses it. A tool remembers its own settings in the visitor\'s browser, nothing else.'],
