                        'heading' => 'How to tune by ear with a fork',
                        'body' => [
                            'Strike the fork and sound your note against it. Two notes that are nearly the same wobble against each other: that\'s beating, and the further apart they are, the faster it goes. Move your note until the wobble slows down and disappears.',
                            'Ring two forks together here (under More) to hear it plainly: A440 and A442 beat twice a second. For longer listening, a drone holds the note as long as you like.',
