                        'body' => [
                            'Tune to the bass and the chord, not to each note\'s piano pitch: the root first, then the fifth, the third and the seventh. In barbershop, most leads keep the melody close to the piano\'s tuning, and the other three parts tune pure around it.',
                            'This tuner checks one voice against a held root, not four singers at once. Use it to learn where each tone of the chord sits, then take that ear to rehearsal.',
                        ],
