                    [
                        'heading' => 'How to practise',
                        'body' => [
                            'A few minutes most days beats an hour once a week. Stay on a level until it feels easy: the bar under the answer shows your last 10, and 8 right offers you the next level. You can always step back with the Level control at the top.',
                            'The intervals you miss come up more often, so your weak spots get the practice. To drill a pair you mix up, open Settings and pick just those two. Always start on the same note makes it easier at first; leave it off once you\'re steady, so you learn the sound of the leap, not the notes. On a computer, the number keys answer, the space bar plays and A plays it again.',
                        ],
