                    [
                        'heading' => 'Singing intervals: hear it, then sing it',
                        'body' => [
                            'Naming an interval and singing one are two halves of the same skill. Try this: before you answer, sing the two notes back, out loud or under your breath. Then answer, and tap Play it again to check yourself.',
                            'Set the range in Settings to where your voice sits, so every interval is one you could sing. A bass might start around E2 to E4, a soprano around C4 to A5.',
