                            'heading' => 'How it\'s built',
                            'body' => [
                                'Stack two thirds on the root: a major third, 4 semitones, then a minor third, 3, on top of that. On C that gives C, E and G. Any note can be the root and the shape stays the same: move the root up or down with − and + and all three notes move with it.',
