                    'heading' => 'A warm-up in a few minutes',
                    'body' => [
                        'Start with the gentlest: lip trills or the humming scale. Then sing the "oo" scale, and finish with do mi so, which jumps between notes instead of stepping. Once through each takes a few minutes in all.',
                        'A warm-up is not a workout. Sing at a medium volume in the middle of your voice, and stop if anything tightens, scratches or hurts.',
