                'hero_lead' => 'Counterpoint is two or more tunes sung at once, each a melody of its own, fitting together. You start by leading a round, and finish by choosing your own line against a melody.',
                'hero_facts' => ['22 lessons, 2 to 4 minutes each', 'About 70 minutes in all', 'No reading music'],
