                'app' => 'range-and-registers',
                'hero_title' => 'Low to high, in one voice.',
                'hero_lead' => 'As you sing higher, your voice changes how it vibrates: chest voice low, head voice high, and a stretch in the middle where either will do. Find your easy range and your break, then cross it without a jump.',
                'hero_facts' => ['About 3 minutes a lesson', 'Under an hour in all', 'No reading music'],
