                        'legend' => ['Peterson and Barney\'s averages for men (1952)', 'The e of "head": roughly 500 and 1800 Hz'],
                        'note' => 'Every vowel is a point on this map, set by its two lowest formants. The composer picks the note; the lyricist, in effect, picks the formants. The singer gives both at once.',
