                'outcomes' => [
                    'Sing a line the way you\'d say it, the strong syllable on the strong beat, with a breath where the thought ends.',
                    'Sing patter, lots of words on two neighbouring notes, clear as it gets quicker.',
                    'Choose a bright sound, built from speech, or a tall, steady legit one, at a medium volume.',
