                'measures' => 'Your notes on pitch, and whether you follow the ribbon on one unbroken sound: a stop is the sound dropping away, never how high or how long you go. The app can\'t tell a lip bubble from a hum, so any easy sound counts, and whether the bubble kept going is a question you answer yourself. Can\'t trill yet? It costs you nothing.',
